  "title": "I Want to Buy a Park Ticket",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2023-10-19",
  "synopsis": "Amy is buying a ticket for the park.\nThis lesson will focus on learning how to buy tickets, ask for map locations, and inquire about park opening hours.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/2232/e1bc0b4792a350d3c434300826cb3bc43e27fc4d.mp3?1696848739",
